WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.680 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:48.500 --> 01:53.460
<i>At the Science and Technology Agency, one of the nominees for this year's Science Academy Award is...</i>

01:53.460 --> 01:57.260
<i>...geologist Toudaiji Subaru.</i>

01:57.260 --> 02:03.640
<i>Mr. Toudaiji has been researching how to control diastrophism manually...</i>

02:03.640 --> 02:08.480
<i>- ...and his thesis has attracted attention from people across the globe.</i>

02:06.100 --> 02:08.480
- Miyako's brother is amazing!

02:08.480 --> 02:12.940
For him to receive the highest honor at such a young age must make your family so proud.

02:12.940 --> 02:17.820
It hasn't been finalized yet. He was just chosen as a nominee.

02:17.820 --> 02:20.990
I'm just happy that he's coming back.

02:20.990 --> 02:24.120
My special wine. Let's celebrate with this.

02:24.120 --> 02:27.120
How many years has it been since he's left the house?

02:28.670 --> 02:30.120
He's here!

02:31.540 --> 02:33.880
<i>Hmph. How boring.</i>

02:33.880 --> 02:39.340
<i>Marital love, brotherly love, family bonding, a heart in love...</i>

02:39.340 --> 02:44.180
Love? Passion? Bonding? What the heck?!

02:44.180 --> 02:46.640
<i>Something that God gave only to humans.</i>

02:46.640 --> 02:50.100
<i>Emotions that humans cherish the most.</i>

02:50.100 --> 02:54.770
<i>Through these emotions, humans live and maintain their connection amongst others.</i>

02:54.770 --> 02:56.530
<i>You must be joking!</i>

02:56.530 --> 03:00.030
<i>I couldn't have lost to crap like that!</i>

03:00.030 --> 03:01.910
I won't forgive them!

03:05.240 --> 03:09.750
Is a Thief an Ally of a Cop?!

03:10.160 --> 03:11.500
CHEERS!!!

03:11.500 --> 03:15.550
This is wonderful! My son is finally back!

03:15.550 --> 03:18.590
With a superior award as an added bonus!

03:18.590 --> 03:20.970
Congratulations, brother.

03:20.970 --> 03:22.680
Congratulations!

03:22.680 --> 03:26.010
You two are brother and sister, yet you're completely different from Miyako!

03:26.010 --> 03:28.560
What do you mean by that...?!

03:34.940 --> 03:37.440
Are you all right, brother?

03:37.440 --> 03:38.860
I'm going to the bathroom...

03:50.370 --> 03:51.750
This stupid thing!

04:00.550 --> 04:04.840
<i>Oh, I'm very sorry, but...</i>

04:04.840 --> 04:09.890
<i>...the judges have decided against giving you the award.</i>

04:10.520 --> 04:16.360
<i>Well, you're young and you have a future ahead of you, so keep trying.</i>

04:19.480 --> 04:25.070
<i>However, your thesis and research program are very interesting.</i>

04:25.070 --> 04:29.620
<i>We'll use it for the greater good, so don't worry about it.</i>

04:29.620 --> 04:33.160
<i>We'll return the disk with your research results.</i>

04:33.160 --> 04:34.040
<i>Here.</i>

04:38.130 --> 04:41.920
<i>How dare you show your face after being denied the award!</i>

04:41.880 --> 04:45.260
<i>I'm so embarrassed that I can't show my face in public!</i>

04:45.260 --> 04:47.760
<i>A brother who can't even get an award is pathetic!</i>

04:47.760 --> 04:48.550
<i>Get out of here!</i>

04:48.550 --> 04:50.470
<i>I don't ever want to see your face again!</i>

04:50.470 --> 04:52.020
<i>Don't ever come back!</i>

04:56.650 --> 05:00.530
Those are the true voices of your family.

05:00.530 --> 05:01.320
Who's there?!

05:01.320 --> 05:04.280
It's no use trying to rely on your family's love.

05:04.280 --> 05:08.620
Everyone's counting on your award, not you yourself.

05:09.740 --> 05:13.620
I'll show you how brittle human love is!

05:26.010 --> 05:27.340
Are you all right?

05:27.340 --> 05:29.350
You don't look well...

05:29.350 --> 05:33.810
You must be tired. Let's wrap things up for tonight.

05:33.810 --> 05:37.140
Tomorrow's the day they announce the winner, isn't it?

05:42.190 --> 05:46.280
Award? It was cancelled!

05:48.990 --> 05:51.700
Cancelled? What do you mean?

05:51.700 --> 05:55.580
The old geezers of the Academy who were afraid of my youth and ability...

05:55.580 --> 06:00.250
...pulled some strings to protect their fame and status.

06:00.250 --> 06:01.540
No way!

06:02.920 --> 06:06.550
I was hoping for an award, but it wasn't meant to be.

06:08.050 --> 06:10.720
The award is no big deal.

06:10.720 --> 06:14.890
The most important thing is the fact that you're back home healthy.

06:14.890 --> 06:16.060
That's a lie!

06:16.060 --> 06:17.390
Don't lie...

06:18.850 --> 06:20.980
In truth, you're disappointed!

06:21.940 --> 06:26.650
I left home after all that big talk, and this is what I have to show for.

06:26.650 --> 06:28.950
Laugh if you want...

06:28.950 --> 06:32.160
That's how everyone really feels!

06:32.160 --> 06:34.950
This isn't healthy, brother. Stop it. Please!

06:34.950 --> 06:35.750
Shut up!

06:42.380 --> 06:43.540
That's enough!!!

06:44.960 --> 06:45.760
Dear...

06:45.760 --> 06:50.300
We were all worried since we hadn't heard from you in so long...

06:50.300 --> 06:53.350
...you finally decide to come back and now look at yourself!!!

06:54.510 --> 06:58.350
Who cares if one or two awards were cancelled?

06:58.350 --> 07:03.150
Have you forgotten what you said when you left this house?!

07:03.150 --> 07:06.070
Those were childish ideals.

07:06.070 --> 07:12.070
Since the day I left to study abroad, I've had to face reality!

07:12.070 --> 07:18.410
In order to continue the research you love, you have to acquire a certain degree of fame and status.

07:18.410 --> 07:22.460
A loser like you wouldn't understand.

07:22.460 --> 07:24.000
What did you say?!

07:24.670 --> 07:27.880
You still view me as a child who doesn't understand?

07:29.090 --> 07:35.970
As an elite recruit, you passed the higher-level government exams, and you had a promising future.

07:35.970 --> 07:41.810
But your supervisors envied you, and you were forced to become a cop in this tiny city.

07:41.810 --> 07:46.690
Since then, you've gotten used to this ordinary life, and you became satisfied with it!

07:46.690 --> 07:49.940
- Subaru, that's not true!

07:48.150 --> 07:49.940
- No, honey, don't say anything.

07:52.320 --> 07:54.370
Is that all you've got to say?!

07:55.240 --> 07:58.540
You and I are different. I'm not going to end up like this!

08:01.500 --> 08:08.000
I don't know what happened during Dad's past, but no one mocks the path that Dad has chosen!

08:08.000 --> 08:10.550
Not even my own brother!

08:10.550 --> 08:11.760
Miyako...

08:11.760 --> 08:15.680
Right now, you're not the brother that had high hopes and dreams of science...

08:15.680 --> 08:18.600
...the brother that I admired!

08:19.140 --> 08:21.600
I hate you!

08:27.820 --> 08:29.900
That's fine with me!

08:29.900 --> 08:31.940
What is that attitude?!

08:31.940 --> 08:33.030
Get out of here!

08:33.030 --> 08:37.910
Don't you dare enter this house again until you fix that rotten attitude of yours!

08:40.870 --> 08:42.080
Subaru!

09:18.200 --> 09:22.160
See? Human love is just like I said.

09:23.250 --> 09:28.130
People only think of themselves, even if you're related by blood.

09:28.130 --> 09:30.880
No one understands how anyone feels.

09:31.670 --> 09:34.760
Come on, come on. You're really stubborn.

09:35.510 --> 09:38.430
Just admit it and get on with it.

09:38.970 --> 09:42.720
Make all those who torment you pay.

09:45.770 --> 09:53.980
Use that research program of yours, and make them acknowledge your ability!

10:01.370 --> 10:07.370
Kill all those who cry out for love, friendship and bonding.

10:08.620 --> 10:11.170
No! I can't do it!

10:30.980 --> 10:33.770
Yes... That's the way!

10:39.450 --> 10:45.950
Oh, geez. All these horrible things I said to my brother slipped right out of my mouth...

10:45.950 --> 10:51.000
That's not true. Your brother was just overwhelmed.

10:51.000 --> 10:52.170
Maron...

10:52.750 --> 10:57.720
Hey, we used to play with your brother at this park.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.510
Yeah!

10:58.970 --> 11:01.050
Pet bottle rocket!

11:05.720 --> 11:07.520
<i>Miyako, that's enough!</i>

11:08.430 --> 11:10.480
<i>Everyone, get out of the way!</i>

11:10.480 --> 11:13.020
<i>- Maron-chan!</i>

11:11.270 --> 11:12.980
<i>- 2...1...0!</i>

11:14.110 --> 11:16.360
<i>Yes! It flies!</i>

11:16.360 --> 11:18.780
<i>Wow, you're great!</i>

11:31.750 --> 11:37.500
A few years later, out of the blue, he said that he wanted to go abroad to study science.

11:37.500 --> 11:40.470
<i>I can't let you do that!</i>

11:40.470 --> 11:43.840
<i>I want a profession that will benefit everyone!</i>

11:43.840 --> 11:47.770
<i>In order to do that, I need to learn more about science!</i>

11:47.770 --> 11:50.730
<i>But there's no need to leave the country...</i>

11:50.730 --> 11:53.850
<i>No matter what anyone says, I'm not changing my mind!</i>

11:54.650 --> 11:58.940
Miyako, I'm leaving Dad and Mom to you!

12:02.110 --> 12:06.580
I understood his feelings because he was committed to science...

12:06.580 --> 12:10.200
I know, Miyako! Why don't you go to your brother's house tomorrow?

12:10.200 --> 12:12.290
Huh? But...

12:12.290 --> 12:15.130
Don't worry. You're brother and sister.

12:15.130 --> 12:18.800
I believe he understood your feelings. Right?

12:22.970 --> 12:25.010
- A-An earthquake?!

12:24.220 --> 12:25.010
- Yeah!

12:33.020 --> 12:34.520
Onii-chan!

12:35.350 --> 12:36.810
It's me, Miyako!

13:14.230 --> 13:15.730
Miyako!

13:15.730 --> 13:17.560
Onii-chan...

13:17.560 --> 13:18.770
Why are you here?!

13:19.400 --> 13:22.780
I followed Miyako because I was worried about her, but...

13:25.280 --> 13:26.450
Are you all right?!

13:26.450 --> 13:27.280
Chiaki!

13:28.820 --> 13:30.030
Hey, let go!

13:30.030 --> 13:31.830
No, listen to me!

13:31.830 --> 13:34.250
I have nothing to say to a liar.

13:34.960 --> 13:40.130
I feel terrible for lying to you. At first, it was just a joke.

13:40.130 --> 13:41.210
I knew it!

13:41.210 --> 13:48.220
However...! From the day I moved in, if I'd never seen a girl sighing in front of the mail box...

13:48.220 --> 13:50.680
If I had never cared for her...

13:50.680 --> 13:53.100
...I would have just quit.

13:53.100 --> 13:55.480
If it hadn't been you, I would have just quit.

13:55.890 --> 13:58.520
Please, return home!

14:02.360 --> 14:06.860
Until the Academy accepts my research, I have no intention of returning home.

14:06.860 --> 14:09.240
Who cares about that anymore?!

14:09.240 --> 14:10.660
Shut up!

14:10.660 --> 14:13.660
To me, it's more important than my own life!

14:13.660 --> 14:18.210
Onii-chan... Onii-chan... You're my Onii-chan, aren't you?!

14:20.630 --> 14:21.880
Onii-chan!

14:24.170 --> 14:27.300
You're not my Onii-chan...

14:27.300 --> 14:30.180
Where did my Onii-chan go?!

14:30.180 --> 14:33.720
Give me back my Onii-chan!

14:38.480 --> 14:40.060
Miyako...

14:40.060 --> 14:40.980
Jeanne!

14:45.900 --> 14:52.070
After Jeanne's robberies, everyone became calm again.

14:53.370 --> 14:56.540
Jeanne, please! Turn Onii-chan back to normal!

14:56.540 --> 14:57.910
Wha...!

14:57.910 --> 15:03.630
I know it's against the rules for a policeman's daughter to ask for this, but...

15:03.630 --> 15:06.760
But please! Please save Onii-chan!

15:07.760 --> 15:08.970
What are you going to do?

15:15.890 --> 15:19.020
<i>- Okay, I'm taking the picture!</i>

15:17.140 --> 15:19.020
<i>- Okay!</i>

15:21.480 --> 15:23.190
Miyako, are you there?

15:23.190 --> 15:24.310
Yes.

15:24.770 --> 15:26.440
There's a letter for you.

15:27.780 --> 15:30.530
There's no return address.

15:33.030 --> 15:35.200
<i>To Toudaiji Miyako-sama:</i>

15:35.200 --> 15:38.500
<i>Tonight, I will steal the beauty of your wish.</i>

15:39.160 --> 15:41.210
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

15:41.210 --> 15:43.500
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

16:05.060 --> 16:07.320
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:07.320 --> 16:09.530
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:09.530 --> 16:11.110
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:17.870 --> 16:21.620
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

16:45.350 --> 16:46.520
That way...

16:56.990 --> 16:58.580
Are you okay?

16:58.580 --> 17:00.950
I'm fine, it's just a scratch!

17:00.950 --> 17:03.210
Why did you save me?

17:03.210 --> 17:06.460
You're an important person to me until I arrest you.

17:07.130 --> 17:09.250
- Welcome, little thief.

17:09.800 --> 17:11.300
Onii-chan!

17:11.300 --> 17:15.220
Miyako, you're a bad girl. How dare you help your enemy...

17:15.220 --> 17:16.590
Here's your punishment!

17:21.220 --> 17:23.270
How are you? Suffering?

17:29.650 --> 17:33.940
But the suffering I endured was much worse than that!

17:34.400 --> 17:39.570
In this computer is the diastrophism system I made for the Science Academy Award.

17:39.570 --> 17:43.250
In other words, it's running a program used to control earthquakes.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.750
Onii-chan...

17:48.170 --> 17:51.420
I'm the one causing the earthquakes that have been occurring since yesterday!

17:51.420 --> 17:54.460
Soon, I will cause an even larger earthquake!

17:56.430 --> 18:00.470
An earthquake large enough to destroy this city!

18:00.470 --> 18:05.020
Then, those who mocked me will take notice!

18:06.890 --> 18:08.230
- How foolish!

18:14.780 --> 18:16.700
Who are you?!

18:16.700 --> 18:19.490
That's just the whining of a loser!

18:19.490 --> 18:24.450
What?! How would someone who doesn't know the situation understand my feelings?!

18:25.750 --> 18:26.750
Die!

18:32.380 --> 18:33.500
Are you okay?!

18:33.500 --> 18:35.170
Take care of Miyako!

18:40.180 --> 18:44.850
How dare you try to ruin the relationship between brother and sister!

18:44.850 --> 18:46.060
I'll never forgive you!

18:46.060 --> 18:48.020
<i>Die!</i>

19:02.530 --> 19:04.990
Jeanne, hurry up!

19:04.990 --> 19:06.660
This place won't hold much longer!

19:06.660 --> 19:07.500
Okay!

19:15.550 --> 19:16.960
In the name of God...

19:19.220 --> 19:21.470
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:23.970 --> 19:26.970
I seal you here!

19:36.980 --> 19:38.570
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:45.450 --> 19:47.120
<i>Collection completed!</i>

19:56.040 --> 19:57.380
We have to hurry up and get out of here!

20:00.670 --> 20:01.840
Onii-chan!

20:01.840 --> 20:03.340
Miyako...

20:04.340 --> 20:05.550
It's dangerous here! Hurry!

20:05.550 --> 20:07.010
Onii-chan!

20:07.010 --> 20:08.390
Don't come this way!

20:09.060 --> 20:10.850
- Onii-chan!

20:09.770 --> 20:10.850
- Miyako!

20:12.350 --> 20:15.440
- Oniiiii-chaaaaan!!!

20:13.650 --> 20:15.440
- What are you doing?! Hurry!

20:15.440 --> 20:17.150
Take care of Miyako!

20:33.040 --> 20:34.580
Looks like this is the end...

20:39.130 --> 20:40.420
Father!

20:40.420 --> 20:42.300
Don't give up!

20:50.810 --> 20:51.810
Mom...

20:51.810 --> 20:53.100
Miyako...

20:53.100 --> 20:56.480
Where's Onii-chan?! Onii-chan!!

20:56.480 --> 20:59.440
Miyako, there's nothing to be worried about.

21:03.400 --> 21:05.410
Father, I...

21:05.410 --> 21:08.580
The police force is a peculiar thing...

21:08.580 --> 21:14.920
The higher in rank you go, the more you lose contact with the civilians that originally needed to be protected.

21:15.170 --> 21:18.880
I wanted to remain as the officer who protects the civilians.

21:20.800 --> 21:25.680
The reason I pursued this job was because I wanted to help people.

21:25.680 --> 21:28.640
Not because I wanted status or fame.

21:30.890 --> 21:32.600
Isn't it the same for you?

21:33.270 --> 21:37.480
The day you left, what you told us didn't have an iota of untruth.

21:37.480 --> 21:38.610
You're right...

21:39.690 --> 21:42.900
As a scholar, I've concentrated too much on the rewards.

21:42.900 --> 21:45.530
I had lost sight of what was truly important.

21:45.530 --> 21:48.990
You've worried your mom a lot.

21:48.990 --> 21:52.740
Let's both try not to lose sight of our original intentions.

21:52.740 --> 21:54.450
Yes, father!

21:55.250 --> 21:58.790
Hmph! Love is disgusting!

21:58.790 --> 22:08.550
Looks like it's up to me to prove that love is only a sweet fantasy.

22:11.100 --> 22:12.010
<i>Jeanne...</i>

22:16.560 --> 22:18.480
<i>I'm kinda jealous...</i>

22:19.310 --> 22:20.770
Let's go, Jeanne.

22:21.900 --> 22:23.940
<i>Isn't it great, Miyako?</i>

22:28.570 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:35.950 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.210 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.800
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.010 --> 23:01.940
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.490 --> 23:14.530
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.740 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.120 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.000
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.210 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.300 --> 23:37.850
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.360 --> 23:51.450
Jeanne, that boy's life won't last very long.

23:51.450 --> 23:52.160
Who is that?!

23:52.160 --> 23:54.740
I am Demon Knight Noin.

23:54.740 --> 23:58.040
That boy's life is extended by a Demon's power.

23:58.040 --> 24:02.790
In other words, that boy will die if you seal the Demon.

24:02.790 --> 24:07.300
That's a lie! I swear I'll save Zen-kun's life!

24:07.300 --> 24:11.090
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: A Boy with a Demon's Heart

24:11.090 --> 24:14.590
Even so, will you still <i>Checkmate?</i>
